**Goal:** `record-processor` acks away messages that cannot validate (logged) and publishes `ProcessedRecord`
with `en` and `fr` translations of title, author, publisher and city.

**Scope:** `services/record-processor/src/record_processor/` — `main.py:handle`, `translate.py`,
