# M01: Event contract v2

## Tasks

**Goal:** record events carry the catalogue `provider`, edition ids and compiled-record fields, and their
published field list is a committed JSON Schema.

**Scope:** `packages/event-schemas` (`models.py`, new `rules.py`, `export_schema.py`, committed
`schemas/`), and every constructor of `RawRecord`/`ProcessedRecord` so the repo stays green:
`services/player/src/player/generator.py`, `services/shelfnet-scraper/src/shelfnet_scraper/mapping.py`,
`services/shelfnet-crawler/src/shelfnet_crawler/{mapping,settings}.py`,
`services/record-processor/src/record_processor/processor.py`, `services/api/src/api/catalog/factories.py`, and
their specs. No behaviour change beyond stamping and passing the new fields.

| Task | Description | Files | SP | Status |
|------|-------------|-------|----|--------|
